00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:29.760
for five years ago or 10 years ago. I think it's&nbsp;
a helpful question to keep revisiting. You need&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:37.020
to decide what it is for you, otherwise it's easy&nbsp;
