00:04:58.140 --> 00:05:04.320
a lot just by whether it fills up your cup or&nbsp;
not. Ideally, you'll be spending more time in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:08.160
the next year on things that fill you with energy&nbsp;
