00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:14.100
Speaking of the things that drain you, maybe&nbsp;
a sub-question that I like to keep in mind is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:20.280
"Does the amount of attention I'm giving this&nbsp;
