of circumstances or in what context are&nbsp;
you asking these questions or these just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:39.240
broadly speaking questions that you're&nbsp;
applying more or less all the time for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:42.600
self-awareness and different types of cycles?
