I'm not thinking about tracking it throughout&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:53.340
the year, but it's there for me as I sit down to&nbsp;
review the year. Those measurements are there as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:57.840
I'm going through these questions and then trying&nbsp;
to figure out where did I direct my attention,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:02.460
what am I optimizing for, am I spending my energy&nbsp;
on things that fill me up or things that drain me?&nbsp;

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.140
Tim Ferriss: Perfect.
James Clear: Another question that&nbsp;&nbsp;

