00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:29.100
Another question I love, and this is actually at&nbsp;
the core of a lot of what I talk about in Atomic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:35.040
Habits, is "How can I create an environment that&nbsp;
