00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:50.700
physical environment, my social environment and&nbsp;
the tribes I'm a part of and my strategy for what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:54.720
I'm trying to achieve so that it's almost&nbsp;
natural that I'm moving in that direction?&nbsp;

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:58.380
I actually have a bunch of questions. I've got&nbsp;
like 20 that I go through, but those are just&nbsp;&nbsp;

