To the systems piece,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:51.120
I think about this a lot and have found for myself&nbsp;
and certainly for many people in my audience, that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.320 --> 00:09:00.720
