important for how I structure my day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:39.900
but I try to do whatever I can to reduce friction&nbsp;
and make it as easy as possible to do it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:46.560
The first thing is I give myself permission to&nbsp;
reduce the scope but stick to the schedule. If&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:51.660
my typical workout takes 45 minutes, but I&nbsp;
