01:04:27.707 --> 01:04:31.020
Tim Ferriss: The Kitchen Safe.&nbsp;
There are a few variations of this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:31.020 --> 01:04:38.340
and I know a number of families who use them&nbsp;
