this interesting contrast between the two.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:27:15.420 --> 01:27:20.520
Another common format, this is the one that I&nbsp;
use for Atomic Habits, is you take the topic&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:27:20.520 --> 01:27:24.960
of your book and then you layer on some&nbsp;
kind of unexpected descriptor before it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

