the title, it's very hard to remark upon it in any&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:31:02.820 --> 01:31:07.800
way that is meaningful. And this also translates&nbsp;
and applies to the table of contents. So in The&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:31:07.800 --> 01:31:14.460
4-Hour Workweek I had this DEAL structure and&nbsp;
I thought very, very, very intently about how&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:31:14.460 --> 01:31:17.340
to structure the book, but then also how&nbsp;
to label the different structures and I&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:31:17.340 --> 01:31:22.740
had multiple options that could have worked.
