01:34:56.580 --> 01:35:03.120
You want to have as much energy as possible in&nbsp;
a tight window. The idea, which Tim you know&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:35:03.120 --> 01:35:08.100
this better than almost anybody, the idea&nbsp;
is to make it seem bigger than it actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:35:08.100 --> 01:35:14.460
