And so I had 75 interviews hit during launch week.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:35:14.460 --> 01:35:19.680
I did an additional 25 during the month that the&nbsp;
book came out. So by the time the book was out for&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:35:19.680 --> 01:35:25.260
one month, I had a hundred interviews that had hit&nbsp;
