01:35:25.260 --> 01:35:30.060
of action going on there. At this point, by the&nbsp;
time the book came out, my email list was around&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:35:30.060 --> 01:35:35.580
400,000-450,000 subscribers, somewhere around&nbsp;
