02:04:07.800 --> 02:04:12.120
knee sleeves and they buy the same workout gear&nbsp;
and it's all these other habits that they never&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:04:12.120 --> 02:04:16.740
intended to build. But they just kind of soaked&nbsp;
them up, because that's what the group was doing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:04:16.740 --> 02:04:21.240
And ultimately, I think this comes back to&nbsp;
this kind of deep need that we all have,&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:04:21.240 --> 02:04:27.060
which is this need to bond and connect.
