02:04:33.900 --> 02:04:39.840
that I don't really love, but I fit in, I&nbsp;
belong, I'm part of something," or "I have&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:04:39.840 --> 02:04:45.480
the habits that I want to have, but I'm cast out,&nbsp;
