02:04:45.480 --> 02:04:50.760
the desire to belong will overpower the&nbsp;
desire to improve. So as best as possible,&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:04:50.760 --> 02:04:54.900
you've got to get those two things aligned&nbsp;
and surround yourself with people where your&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:04:54.900 --> 02:04:59.880
desired behavior is the normal behavior.
