02:06:19.980 --> 02:06:26.147
and ask yourself, "what behaviors are obvious&nbsp;
here? What is this space designed to encourage?"&nbsp;

02:06:26.147 --> 02:06:28.860
Tim Ferriss: Yeah, that's really good.
