we do it to ourselves all the time. So try to&nbsp;
design a space where you are being served by your&nbsp;&nbsp;

02:08:14.940 --> 02:08:18.360
environment, rather than being hindered by it.
Tim Ferriss: Yeah, totally. I think it was,&nbsp;&nbsp;

